      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "NORTHWIND ANALYTICS PRIVATE LIMITED\nWORK FROM HOME POLICY\nPolicy No. HR/POL/07 Effective from 1 July 2026\n1. Purpose\n1.1 This policy explains when employees may work from home.\n2. Eligibility\n2.1 Employees who have completed probation are eligible to work from home for up to two (2) days per week.\n3. Responsibilities\n3.1 Employees must be reachable during core hours of 11:00 to 16:00.\n4. Data Security\n4.1 Company data must not be stored on personal devices.\n5. Withdrawal\n5.1 The Company may withdraw this facility by giving seven (7) days' notice."
    }
  ],
